INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('61','12','11','<p>Caller&nbsp; &nbsp;: Hello I\'m Karen from Lotty the Italian restaurant . . . . . .</p>\r\n<p>Call receiver: I\'m so sorry that extension is busy at this moment.</p>','1','<p>May I speak to that extension?</p>','<table width=\"756\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"702\">\r\n<p>Could you connect me to the extension 24?</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<table width=\"756\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"702\">\r\n<p>Do you know the extension 24?</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<p>I\'ll connect you to extension 24</p>','<p>Where can find extension 24</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('62','12','12','<p>Caller: Is Mr. Georgy in the office.</p>\r\n<p>Receptionist: Yes he is. May I know who\'s calling?</p>\r\n<p>Caller: I\'m Evan from DT Foundation. May I speak to him?</p>\r\n<p>Receptionist :&nbsp; . . . . .&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Caller : It\'s ok. I understand..</p>','1','<p>Would you like me to tell him that you called?</p>','<p>Could you hold the line please, I\'ll connect you to him</p>','<p>I\'m sorry, I\'m afraid He\'s not able to answer your call, He is busy right now.</p>','<p>Nice meeting you</p>','<p>One moment please, I\'ll check if he is available</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('63','12','13','<p>Anita: Hello, Dimensi Bahasa Inggris Enterprise, what can I do for you?</p>\r\n<p>Lex: Hello, I would like to speak to Mr. Neezar pelase.</p>\r\n<p>Anita: I\'m sorry, Mr. Neezar is on meeting at this moment.&nbsp; . . . . . .</p>\r\n<p>Lex: Sure, thank you. Just tell him I called.</p>','1','<p>Would you like me to tell him that you called?</p>','<p>May I write down your message?</p>','<p>May I know who\'s calling?</p>','<p>Could you call him back?</p>','<p>Can you spill the name?</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('64','12','16','<p>Dili : What\'s your opinion about that novel?</p>\r\n<p>Theo: I like it. It is an interesting story</p>\r\n<p>From the dialogue we conclude that ...</p>','1','<p>Dili is giving her opinion.</p>','<p>Theo doesn\'t like the novel.</p>','<p>Dili is asking Theo\'s opinion.</p>','<p>Dili agrees with Theo\'s opinion.</p>','<p>Dili is having good story</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('65','12','29','<p>What should a receptionist do when welcoming a new guest?</p>','1','<p>Hand over the room key without checking the reservation</p>','<p>Ask for contact information rather than the guest\'s name</p>','<p>Ask the guest to wait in the lobby without giving directions</p>','<p>Greet the guest politely and check their reservation</p>','<p>Ask the number hotel</p>','D','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('66','12','32','<p>What should be done when a guest has a complaint or issue?<strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong></p>','1','<p>Ignore it because it\'s not the receptionist\'s problem</p>','<p>Provide a rude response to make the guest understand</p>','<p>Listen patiently and make efforts to resolve the issue</p>','<p>Tell them to leave the property</p>','<p>Ignore the problem</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('67','12','33','<p>Customers : Hello Good Morning</p>\r\n<p>Clothing store : Good Morning, What can I do for you?</p>\r\n<p>Customers : I recently purchased a shirt from your store, but it has a tear on the sleeve.</p>\r\n<p>Clothing store : We\'re sorry for the defect in the shirt. Please bring it back to our store,and ......&hellip;&hellip;</p>','1','<p>We\'ll exchange it for a new one.</p>','<p>You have to buy a new one</p>','<p>We will contact you soon</p>','<p>We cannot accept the complaint</p>','<p>We will clean it</p>','A','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('68','12','34','<p>Why is it important to understand the needs and preferences of guests?</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>','1','<p>Because it will waste the receptionist\'s time</p>','<p>Because guests never know what they want</p>','<p>Because it helps provide a satisfying experience for guests</p>','<p>Because guests don\'t need to be attended to</p>','<p>Because not important</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('69','12','35','<p>Customer: \"Good afternoon, I\'d like to speak to the manager, please.\"</p>\r\n<p>Store Employee: \"Of course, may I ask what this is regarding?\"</p>\r\n<p>Customer: \"I purchased a defective blender from your store last week, and I\'m quite disappointed with the quality.\"</p>\r\n<p>Store Employee: &ldquo;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;..&rdquo;Let me get the manager for you right away.\"</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>','1','<p>Thank you Miss</p>','<p>I really appreciate that</p>','','<p>You\'re welcome</p>','<p>I\'m really sorry to hear that</p>','E','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('70','12','40','<p>Ticket holders&nbsp; : Hello, I just found out that the concert I bought tickets for has been canceled.</p>\r\n<p>Concert promoter : We apologize for the inconvenience. The cancellation is due to unforeseen circumstances.&rdquo;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&rdquo;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Complete the conversation above!</strong></p>','1','<p>We\'ll process a refund for your tickets.</p>','<p>We&rsquo;ll resolve it immediately</p>','<p>Sorry, we can\'t replace it</p>','<p>Repurchase the ticket</p>','<p>Buy a ticket concert</p>','A','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('71','11','1','<p>Widi : I always forget to back up my files.</p>\r\n<p>Hani : oh yah ?.......................................</p>','1','<p>Let me do it for you</p>','<p>You should back up your files every day</p>','<p>I don&rsquo;t know how to do it</p>','<p>That&rsquo;s not important</p>','<p>Ask the teacher how</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('72','11','2','<p>Andy : Oh my Godness, My presentation looks boring.</p>\r\n<p>Rudy: No, I don&rsquo;t think so,&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;.</p>','1','<p>You could add more pictures and colors</p>','<p>I will make it for you</p>','<p>Don&rsquo;t present it</p>','<p>That&rsquo;s fine</p>','<p>Ask the teacher</p>','A','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('73','11','3','<p>Customer: I don&rsquo;t know what to order right now&hellip;..</p>\r\n<p>Waiter: I see,&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;..</p>','1','<p>Let me choose for you</p>','<p>Why don&rsquo;t you try our special menu?</p>','<p>Look at the menu yourself</p>','<p>It&rsquo;s all the same</p>','<p>I&rsquo;m &hellip;</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('74','11','4','<p>Ardi : I&rsquo;m nervous before the English test tomorrow.</p>\r\n<p>Adjie : don&rsquo;t worry,&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;.</p>','1','<p>Ask your friend</p>','<p>Don&rsquo;t take the test</p>','<p>I will do the test for you</p>','<p>That&rsquo;s okay</p>','<p>You should study and get enough sleep</p>','E','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('75','11','5','<p>Funny : My computer runs very slowly.</p>\r\n<p>Widy : &hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;</p>','1','<p>Turn it off forever</p>','<p>Let me buy you a new one</p>','<p>You could delete unnecessary files</p>','<p>It&rsquo;s normal</p>','<p>Ignore it</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('76','11','6','<p>Teacher: Your design lacks creativity.</p>\r\n<p>Student: ............</p>','1','<p>I will stop designing</p>','<p>Maybe I should look for more inspiration online</p>','<p>You do it for me</p>','<p>That&rsquo;s okay</p>','<p>I don&rsquo;t care</p>','E','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('77','11','7','<p>Friend A: I can&rsquo;t speak English fluently.</p>\r\n<p>Friend B: ...........</p>','1','<p>It&rsquo;s too hard</p>','<p>Let me speak for you</p>','<p>Stop learning English</p>','<p>You should practice speaking every day</p>','<p>Ask someone else</p>','D','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('78','11','8','<p>Customer: The food is too salty.</p>\r\n<p>Chef&nbsp; : ..............</p>','1','<p>I suggest adding a little lemon juice to balance the taste</p>','<p>You should not eat it</p>','<p>Throw it away</p>','<p>It&rsquo;s fine</p>','<p>Complain to the manager</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('79','11','9','<p>Student A: I keep making mistakes in my accounting report.</p>\r\n<p>Student B: ..........</p>','1','<p>Don&rsquo;t submit it</p>','<p>Let me make the report for you</p>','<p>You should double-check your numbers before submitting</p>','<p>It&rsquo;s okay to be wrong</p>','<p>Ask your friend</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('80','11','10','<p>Friend A: I don&rsquo;t have any idea for my project.</p>\r\n<p>Friend B: ..............</p>','1','<p>Why don&rsquo;t you make a simple website for a local shop?</p>','<p>Let me do your project</p>','<p>Copy from the internet</p>','<p>Skip the project</p>','<p>Ask the teacher to give the idea</p>','A','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('81','11','11','<p>11. Student A: I feel sleepy in class.</p>\r\n<p>Student B: ..............</p>','1','<p>It&rsquo;s okay</p>','<p>Let me wake you up</p>','<p>Don&rsquo;t come to class</p>','<p>Drink coffee all day</p>','<p>You should sleep earlier at night</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('82','11','12','<p>Customer: I want to promote my small business online.</p>\r\n<p>Shop Owner: ...............</p>','1','<p>Ask your friend</p>','<p>Let me promote it for free</p>','<p>Don&rsquo;t promote it</p>','<p>It&rsquo;s too expensive</p>','<p>You could use social media marketing</p>','E','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('83','11','13','<p>Friend A: My room is always messy.</p>\r\n<p>Friend B: ................</p>','1','<p>Move to another room</p>','<p>Let me clean it for you</p>','<p>Leave it messy</p>','<p>You should clean it every day</p>','<p>It&rsquo;s not a problem</p>','D','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('84','11','14','<p>Student A: I don&rsquo;t understand this networking topic.</p>\r\n<p>Student B: ...........</p>','1','<p>You should read the textbook again and watch a tutorial</p>','<p>Let me explain everything for you</p>','<p>Skip the topic</p>','<p>Ask someone else</p>','<p>It&rsquo;s too hard</p>','A','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('85','11','15','<p>Friend A: I want to be healthier than before.</p>\r\n<p>Friend B: ..............</p>','1','<p>Let me cook for you</p>','<p>You should exercise regularly and eat vegetables</p>','<p>Don&rsquo;t worry about it</p>','<p>Eat fast food less</p>','<p>Sleep more</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('86','11','16','<p>Anna: I have a headache.</p>\r\n<p>Bella: _________ glish movies</p>','1','<p>You should get some rest.</p>','<p>That&rsquo;s not my problem.</p>','<p>I don&rsquo;t care.</p>','<p>Let&rsquo;s play a game.</p>','<p>I think you&rsquo;re fine.</p>','A','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('87','11','17','Which sentence is an example of giving a suggestion?','1','What is your hobby?','Where do you live?','You should go to the doctor.','How old are you?','What is your problem','C',NULL,'','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('88','11','18','Which of the following is an expression to ask for a suggestion?','1','I suggest you study harder.','You can try meditation.','What should I do?','You&rsquo;d better stay home.','You should take a rest','C',NULL,'','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('89','11','19','<p>Budi: I&rsquo;m hungry but I don&rsquo;t want to cook.</p>\r\n<p>Aldi: ____________________.</p>','1','<p>Let&rsquo;s order some food online.</p>','<p>You should buy a new phone.</p>','<p>Go to school now.</p>','<p>I think you&rsquo;re fine.</p>','<p>How about playing game</p>','A','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('90','11','20','<p>Dian: I want to improve my English.</p>\r\n<p>Sari: __________________?</p>','1','<p>What are you doing?</p>','<p>Let&rsquo;s go shopping</p>','<p>Can I help you?</p>','<p>Why don&rsquo;t you watch English movies</p>','<p>Why don&rsquo;t you go to picnic</p>','D','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('91','11','21','<p>Rudi : This report needs to be submitted in 30 minutes, but my laptop just crashed.</p>\r\n<p>Benny : ___________</p>','1','<p>You should have saved it earlier. That&rsquo;s your fault.</p>','<p>I can lend you my laptop if you need it right away.</p>','<p>The manager won&rsquo;t accept late reports anyway.</p>','<p>Try restarting it yourself first.</p>','<p>I don&rsquo;t have time to deal with this.</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('92','11','22','<p>Customer: I&rsquo;m not sure if this software is compatible with my system.</p>\r\n<p>Technician: ___________</p>','1','<p>You&rsquo;d better buy a new computer instead.</p>','<p>It should work. Just install it and see.</p>','<p>Would you like me to check the system requirements for you?</p>','<p>That&rsquo;s not my job. Ask the sales team.</p>','<p>I can&rsquo;t help you with technical issues.</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('93','11','23','<p>Ammy : I&rsquo;ve been struggling with the CAD design for days.</p>\r\n<p>Ranny : ________</p>','1','<p>Ask the teacher to do it for you.</p>','<p>You should just copy someone else&rsquo;s design.</p>','<p>CAD is too difficult for SMK students anyway.</p>','<p>I&rsquo;m not good at CAD either, so good luck.</p>','<p>Let me take a look. Maybe I can spot what&rsquo;s causing the error</p>','E','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('94','11','24','<p>Guest : Excuse me, I think I left my folder in the meeting room.</p>\r\n<p>Receptionist: _________</p>','1','<p>I&rsquo;ll check the room for you immediately.</p>','<p>You should be more careful next time.</p>','<p>We&rsquo;re not responsible for lost items.</p>','<p>Go check it yourself. I&rsquo;m busy.</p>','<p>It&rsquo;s probably gone by now.</p>','A','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('95','11','25','<p>Manager: The presentation slides look inconsistent.</p>\r\n<p>Staff: __________</p>','1','<p>That&rsquo;s not a big deal. The client won&rsquo;t notice.</p>','<p>Shall I revise the design and send you the updated version?</p>','<p>You should have told me earlier.</p>','<p>I don&rsquo;t have the original files anymore.</p>','<p>Let&rsquo;s cancel the meeting then.</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('96','11','26','<p>Customer: I accidentally deleted the invoice from my email.</p>\r\n<p>Admin: _______</p>','1','<p>Go check your trash folder yourself.</p>','<p>I can&rsquo;t retrieve deleted emails.</p>','<p>Identification</p>','<p>You can re-download it from the system. Do you want me to resend the link?</p>','<p>You&rsquo;ll have to pay again.</p>','D','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('97','11','27','<p>Intern: I&rsquo;m not sure how to operate this CNC machine safely.</p>\r\n<p>Supervisor: _______</p>','1','<p>Just press the buttons and figure it out.</p>','<p>I&rsquo;ll demonstrate the procedure first, then you can practice under supervision.</p>','<p>You shouldn&rsquo;t be assigned here if you don&rsquo;t know how.</p>','<p>Watch a YouTube tutorial later.</p>','<p>It&rsquo;s fine. The machine has a safety lock.</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('98','11','28','<p>Client : The delivery arrived damaged. We need a replacement urgently.</p>\r\n<p>Logistics Officer: ______</p>','1','<p>I&rsquo;ll process a replacement shipment today and update you on the tracking number.</p>','<p>That&rsquo;s the courier&rsquo;s problem, not ours.</p>','<p>You should have checked the package before signing.</p>','<p>We don&rsquo;t accept complaints after delivery.</p>','<p>Wait for the next shipment cycle.</p>','A','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('99','11','29','<p>Student A: I missed the explanation about inventory management.</p>\r\n<p>Student B: ____</p>','1','<p>Inventory management isn&rsquo;t important anyway.</p>','<p>It&rsquo;s too late now. You should have attended.</p>','<p>I don&rsquo;t have my notes anymore.</p>','<p>Ask the teacher to repeat it for you.</p>','<p>You can review the recorded session. Do you want me to share the link?</p>','E','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('100','11','30','<p>Teacher: The lab computers are running very slowly during the test.</p>\r\n<p>Lab Assistant : _________</p>','1','<p>I&rsquo;ll check if there are background programs consuming resources and restart them.</p>','<p>The students should bring their own laptops next time.</p>','<p>That&rsquo;s a network issue. I can&rsquo;t fix it.</p>','<p>Let them finish the test slowly.</p>','<p>We should cancel the test.</p>','A','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('101','11','31','<p>CNC machines, or Computer Numerical Control machines, are automated tools used in manufacturing to cut, shape, and drill materials such as metal, wood, and plastic with high precision. Unlike manual machines, CNC machines operate based on programmed instructions stored in a computer system. This reduces human error and increases production efficiency. However, skilled operators are still required to set up and monitor the machines.</p>\r\n<p>Question :The primary advantage of CNC machines over manual machines is that they...</p>','1','<p>Require no human supervision at all</p>','<p>Can only process metal materials</p>','<p>Operate based on programmed instructions, reducing human error</p>','<p>Are cheaper to maintain</p>','<p>Produce less accurate results</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('102','11','32','<p>CNC machines, or Computer Numerical Control machines, are automated tools used in manufacturing to cut, shape, and drill materials such as metal, wood, and plastic with high precision. Unlike manual machines, CNC machines operate based on programmed instructions stored in a computer system. This reduces human error and increases production efficiency. However, skilled operators are still required to set up and monitor the machines.</p>\r\n<p>Question: According to the text, why are skilled operators still needed?</p>','1','<p>To write the software for the machine</p>','<p>To repair the machine when it breaks down</p>','<p>To sell the products made by the machine</p>','<p>Great</p>','<p>To sell the products made by the machine</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('103','11','33','<p>Hydraulic systems use liquid under pressure to transmit power. These systems are widely used in heavy equipment such as excavators, cranes, and forklifts because they can generate a large amount of force with relatively small components. The basic principle is Pascal&rsquo;s Law, which states that pressure applied to a confined fluid is transmitted equally in all directions.</p>\r\n<p>Question : What is the main reason hydraulic systems are used in heavy equipment?</p>','1','<p>They are easier to repair than mechanical systems</p>','<p>They generate large force with relatively small components</p>','<p>They consume less fuel than electric systems</p>','<p>They do not require maintenance</p>','<p>They operate faster than pneumatic systems</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('104','11','34','<p>Hydraulic systems use liquid under pressure to transmit power. These systems are widely used in heavy equipment such as excavators, cranes, and forklifts because they can generate a large amount of force with relatively small components. The basic principle is Pascal&rsquo;s Law, which states that pressure applied to a confined fluid is transmitted equally in all directions.</p>\r\n<p>Question : The term &ldquo;confined fluid&rdquo; in the text refers to...</p>','1','<p>Water flowing in a river</p>','<p>Liquid that is restricted within a system</p>','<p>Gas used in pneumatic systems</p>','<p>Oil that leaks from the machine</p>','<p>Fluid exposed to the atmosphere</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('105','11','35','<p>Accounting cycle is a systematic process that accountants follow to record and process a company&rsquo;s financial transactions. The cycle begins with identifying and analyzing transactions, followed by recording them in journals, posting to ledgers, preparing a trial balance, making adjusting entries, and finally preparing financial statements. This cycle ensures accuracy and consistency in financial reporting.</p>\r\n<p>Question:&nbsp; Which of the following is the correct sequence of the accounting cycle?</p>','1','<p>Trial balance &rarr; Journal &rarr; Ledger &rarr; Financial statements</p>','<p>Journal &rarr; Ledger &rarr; Trial balance &rarr; Financial statements</p>','<p>Ledger &rarr; Journal &rarr; Adjusting entries &rarr; Trial balance</p>','<p>Financial statements &rarr; Journal &rarr; Ledger &rarr; Trial balance</p>','<p>Adjusting entries &rarr; Journal &rarr; Ledger &rarr; Financial statements</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('106','11','36','<p>Accounting cycle is a systematic process that accountants follow to record and process a company&rsquo;s financial transactions. The cycle begins with identifying and analyzing transactions, followed by recording them in journals, posting to ledgers, preparing a trial balance, making adjusting entries, and finally preparing financial statements. This cycle ensures accuracy and consistency in financial reporting.</p>\r\n<p>Question : The main purpose of the accounting cycle is to ensure...</p>','1','<p>Faster transaction processing</p>','<p>Lower operational costs</p>','<p>Accuracy and consistency in financial reporting</p>','<p>More sales for the company</p>','<p>Automatic tax calculation</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('107','11','37','<p>Dengue fever is a mosquito-borne viral disease common in tropical and subtropical regions. It is transmitted primarily by the Aedes aegypti mosquito. Symptoms include high fever, severe headache, pain behind the eyes, joint and muscle pain, and rash. There is no specific treatment, but early detection and supportive care can reduce complications.</p>\r\n<p>Question : Based on the text, what can be inferred about dengue fever?</p>','1','<p>It is caused by bacteria and can be cured with antibiotics</p>','<p>It spreads through contaminated food and water</p>','<p>It is more common in cold climates</p>','<p>It is transmitted by mosquitoes and requires early detection</p>','<p>It has a specific antiviral treatment available</p>','D','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('108','11','38','<p>Dengue fever is a mosquito-borne viral disease common in tropical and subtropical regions. It is transmitted primarily by the Aedes aegypti mosquito. Symptoms include high fever, severe headache, pain behind the eyes, joint and muscle pain, and rash. There is no specific treatment, but early detection and supportive care can reduce complications.</p>\r\n<p>Question : The phrase &ldquo;mosquito-borne&rdquo; means a disease that is...</p>','1','<p>Caused by mosquito bites</p>','<p>Prevented by mosquito repellent</p>','<p>Found only in mosquitoes</p>','<p>Transmitted by contaminated water</p>','<p>Treated by killing mosquitoes</p>','A','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('109','11','39','<p>Renewable energy sources, such as solar, wind, and hydroelectric power, are derived from natural processes that are replenished constantly. Unlike fossil fuels, renewable energy produces little to no greenhouse gas emissions during operation. However, challenges include high initial installation costs and dependency on weather conditions.</p>\r\n<p>Question : What is one limitation of renewable energy mentioned in the text?</p>','1','<p>It causes more air pollution than fossil fuels</p>','<p>It requires no maintenance</p>','<p>It depends on weather conditions</p>','<p>It is only available in urban areas</p>','<p>It produces more energy than fossil fuels</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('110','11','40','<p>Renewable energy sources, such as solar, wind, and hydroelectric power, are derived from natural processes that are replenished constantly. Unlike fossil fuels, renewable energy produces little to no greenhouse gas emissions during operation. However, challenges include high initial installation costs and dependency on weather conditions.</p>\r\n<p>Question : The main contrast between renewable energy and fossil fuels in the text is that renewable energy...</p>','1','<p>Is more expensive to operate daily</p>','<p>Produces little to no greenhouse gas emissions during operation</p>','<p>Cannot be used for electricity generation</p>','<p>Requires more land than fossil fuel plants</p>','<p>Is harder to store than fossil fuels Kunci B</p>','C','','','','','','','');
